      "architectureView": "Docker best practices cover: build (multi-stage, .dockerignore, pinned versions, layer order), security (non-root, read-only, dropped capabilities, seccomp, AppArmor), operations (resource limits, restart policy, logging driver, health check), and observability (metrics, labels, logging).",
