        "productionMeaning": "SQLAlchemy is the standard Python ORM. It provides connection pooling (configurable size, overflow), async support (asyncpg for PostgreSQL), migration management (Alembic), and database-agnostic query building. Always use parameterized queries — never f-strings with user input."
