        "explanation": "Deployment with 3 replicas and RollingUpdate strategy. maxSurge=1 allows 1 extra pod during update, maxUnavailable=0 ensures zero downtime (at least 3 pods available at all times). The selector matches the pod template labels — critical for Rollback to work correctly.",
        "productionMeaning": "Deployments provide: declarative updates (roll forward), rollback (undo), scaling (manual or HPA), and self-healing (replaces failed pods). RollingUpdate strategy with maxUnavailable=0 ensures zero-downtime deployments. Use maxSurge=1 for most apps, increase for large rollouts."
