      "productionScenario": "Deploy v2 with a bug. After rollout, 5xx errors spike. Run kubectl rollout undo deployment/myapp — Kubernetes rolls back to v1, restoring service. The rollback uses the previous ReplicaSet. This is why you never delete old ReplicaSets — Kubernetes keeps 10 by default (revisionHistoryLimit).",
