      "architectureView": "Deployment creates ReplicaSets which create Pods. RollingUpdate: creates new RS with replicas=1, scales up new RS, scales down old RS, repeats until desired replicas reached. The selector must match pod labels — immutable after creation. revisionHistoryLimit controls how many old RS to keep (for rollback). Paused deployments allow manual canary analysis before continuing.",
