      "architectureView": "EKS architecture: AWS manages control plane (multi-AZ, auto-scaling, patching). Customer manages: nodegroups (EC2 instances), VPC networking, security groups, IAM roles. eksctl creates: VPC (optional), control plane, nodegroups. For production: separate VPC with public/private subnets, VPC endpoints for ECR/S3/CloudWatch, S3 bucket for OIDC discovery doc, dedicated etcd encryption key (KMS).",
