        "midSize": "2-3 nodegroups: on-demand (critical), Spot (batch), taints for isolation.",
        "enterprise": "5+ nodegroups per cluster: on-demand, Spot, GPU, ARM (Graviton), memory-optimized. Node auto-repair for unhealthy nodes.",
