        "CHECK: Check server logs — database connection?",
        "ROOT CAUSE: Training script uses local tracking URI ('file:./mlruns') instead of shared server",
        "FIX: Set MLFLOW_TRACKING_URI environment variable before training",
        "PREVENTION: Set tracking URI in a central config file; use env vars in CI/CD"
