        "midSize": "Feast feature store, shared feature definitions across teams, basic monitoring.",
        "enterprise": "Tecton/Feast on EKS, automated feature engineering, feature drift monitoring, feature importance tracking, cost attribution per team.",
        "faang": "Internal feature platforms with auto-feature engineering, real-time feature computation (Flink), and ML-based feature importance scoring."
