        "midSize": "Mixture of API and self-hosted (vLLM) models, prompt management system, basic caching.",
        "enterprise": "Fine-tuned open-source models (Llama, Mistral) on-premises, sophisticated prompt engineering with guardrails, model routing (small fast model for simple queries, large for complex).",
        "faang": "Custom foundation models, hardware-software co-design for inference (TPU, Inferentia), model distillation for cost optimization, real-time fine-tuning."
