        "explanation": "MLflow on K8s: tracking server (FastAPI) + PostgreSQL (backend store) + S3 (artifact store). Pods are stable (0 restarts in 30 days). The tracking server exposes UI at port 5000. PostgreSQL stores experiment metadata. S3 stores model artifacts.",
