      "productionScenario": "MLflow deployment on EKS: Helm chart with PostgreSQL (StatefulSet, persistent volume) and tracking server (Deployment). Artifact store = S3 (IRSA for pod permissions). CI/CD pipeline: train → log to MLflow → register model → promote to Production → CI/CD triggers vLLM deployment update to load new model weights.",
