        "output": "Historical features (training data): 100K rows, point-in-time correct\nColumns: user_id, event_timestamp, purchase_count_7d, avg_order_value_30d, days_since_last_purchase, support_tickets_30d, label\n\nOnline features for user 42:\n{'purchase_count_7d': [5], 'avg_order_value_30d': [49.99], 'days_since_last_purchase': [3]}",
        "explanation": "Offline: get point-in-time correct training data (no data leakage) with labels. Online: real-time feature vector by entity key via Redis.",
