      "productionScenario": "Monitoring dashboard: feature freshness per view (green < 1h, yellow < 6h, red > 6h). Redis memory (alert > 80%). Latency p99 (alert > 10ms). Automated: stale feature trigger re-materialization, high memory trigger Redis cluster scale-up.",
