        "output": "MLOps Engineer Career Path:\n\nAssociate -> ML Engineer -> Senior -> Staff -> Principal\n\nKey Skills:\n  Core: Python, SQL, Spark, Docker, K8s\n  MLOps: MLflow, Feast, DVC, CML, Airflow\n  Monitoring: Prometheus, Grafana, Evidently\n  Serving: FastAPI, REST APIs\n  Cloud: AWS/GCP/Azure\n  CI/CD: GitHub Actions, GitLab\n\nGrowth: Run pipelines -> Design -> Architect -> Strategy",
